{"seq":3,"slug":"linux-shell-scripting","title":"Linux 与 Shell 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/linux-shell-scripting","wordCount":706,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"linux-与-shell-脚本\">Linux 与 Shell 脚本</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>大数据基础设施几乎全部运行在 Linux 操作系统上。从 Hadoop 集群的日常运维到 ETL 脚本的自动化调度，Linux 命令行操作能力和 Shell 编程技能是大数据工程师的基本功。掌握这些技能意味着你能高效地管理服务器、处理日志、调度任务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"文件系统与权限管理\">文件系统与权限管理</h3><p>Linux 文件系统的层级结构和权限模型是系统操作的基础：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 目录结构认知&#10;/etc/hadoop/conf/       # Hadoop 配置文件&#10;/var/log/               # 系统与应用日志&#10;/opt/spark/             # Spark 安装目录&#10;/data/hdfs/             # HDFS 本地存储路径&#10;&#10;# 权限管理（大数据服务通常用专用用户运行）&#10;chmod 750 /opt/hadoop/bin/    # owner=rwx, group=rx, other=无&#10;chown -R hdfs:hadoop /data/hdfs/&#10;# 数字权限：r=4, w=2, x=1，所以 750 = rwxr-x---&#10;&#10;# 磁盘与空间监控&#10;df -h                   # 文件系统使用率&#10;du -sh /data/hdfs/*     # 各目录大小&#10;lsblk                   # 块设备信息\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 目录结构认知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/etc/hadoop/conf/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # Hadoop 配置文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/var/log/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 系统与应用日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/opt/spark/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # Spark 安装目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/data/hdfs/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # HDFS 本地存储路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 权限管理（大数据服务通常用专用用户运行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 750</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/hadoop/bin/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # owner=rwx, group=rx, other=无</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hdfs:hadoop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data/hdfs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数字权限：r=4, w=2, x=1，所以 750 = rwxr-x---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 磁盘与空间监控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">df</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 文件系统使用率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">du</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data/hdfs/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 各目录大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lsblk</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 块设备信息</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cron-定时调度\">Cron 定时调度</h3><p>Cron 是 Linux 内置的任务调度器，在轻量级 ETL 场景中广泛使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# crontab 格式：分 时 日 月 周 命令&#10;# ┌─── 分钟 (0-59)&#10;# │ ┌─── 小时 (0-23)&#10;# │ │ ┌─── 日 (1-31)&#10;# │ │ │ ┌─── 月 (1-12)&#10;# │ │ │ │ ┌─── 周几 (0-7, 0和7都是周日)&#10;# │ │ │ │ │&#10;  0 2 * * * /opt/scripts/daily_etl.sh &gt;&gt; /var/log/etl.log 2&gt;&amp;1&#10; 30 * * * * /opt/scripts/hourly_sync.sh&#10;  0 0 1 * * /opt/scripts/monthly_report.sh&#10;&#10;# 常用操作&#10;crontab -e              # 编辑当前用户的调度表&#10;crontab -l              # 查看已有任务\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># crontab 格式：分 时 日 月 周 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ┌─── 分钟 (0-59)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># │ ┌─── 小时 (0-23)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># │ │ ┌─── 日 (1-31)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># │ │ │ ┌─── 月 (1-12)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># │ │ │ │ ┌─── 周几 (0-7, 0和7都是周日)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># │ │ │ │ │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/scripts/daily_etl.sh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/etl.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/scripts/hourly_sync.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/scripts/monthly_report.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 常用操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">crontab</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 编辑当前用户的调度表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">crontab</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 查看已有任务</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键注意事项：Cron 环境变量与交互式 Shell 不同，需要在脚本中显式设置 <code>PATH</code> 或使用绝对路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"awk-文本处理\">AWK 文本处理</h3><p>AWK 是面向列的流式文本处理语言，特别适合处理日志和 CSV 数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 基础：打印特定列&#10;awk &#39;{print $1, $4}&#39; access.log       # IP 和时间戳&#10;&#10;# 条件过滤 + 计算&#10;awk &#39;$9 &gt;= 500 {count++} END {print &quot;5xx errors:&quot;, count}&#39; access.log&#10;&#10;# 分组统计：按状态码统计请求数&#10;awk &#39;{status[$9]++} END {for (s in status) print s, status[s]}&#39; access.log&#10;&#10;# 复杂示例：计算每小时平均响应时间&#10;awk -F&#39;[[ :]&#39; &#39;{&#10;    hour = $5&#10;    time_ms = $NF&#10;    sum[hour] += time_ms&#10;    count[hour]++&#10;}&#10;END {&#10;    for (h in sum) printf &quot;Hour %s: avg %.2f ms\\n&quot;, h, sum[h]/count[h]&#10;}&#39; access.log\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础：打印特定列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $4}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # IP 和时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 条件过滤 + 计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$9 >= 500 {count++} END {print \"5xx errors:\", count}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分组统计：按状态码统计请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{status[$9]++} END {for (s in status) print s, status[s]}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 复杂示例：计算每小时平均响应时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[[ :]'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    hour = $5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    time_ms = $NF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    sum[hour] += time_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    count[hour]++</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">END {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    for (h in sum) printf \"Hour %s: avg %.2f ms\\n\", h, sum[h]/count[h]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sed-流编辑器\">SED 流编辑器</h3><p>SED 擅长对文本进行行级别的查找替换和变换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 替换配置文件中的参数&#10;sed -i &#39;s/dfs.replication=2/dfs.replication=3/g&#39; hdfs-site.xml&#10;&#10;# 删除空行和注释行&#10;sed &#39;/^$/d; /^#/d&#39; config.properties &gt; config_clean.properties&#10;&#10;# 在特定行后插入内容&#10;sed &#39;/\\[core-site\\]/a\\    fs.defaultFS=hdfs://namenode:9000&#39; hadoop.conf&#10;&#10;# 提取特定范围的行&#10;sed -n &#39;100,200p&#39; huge_log.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 替换配置文件中的参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/dfs.replication=2/dfs.replication=3/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hdfs-site.xml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 删除空行和注释行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^$/d; /^#/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config_clean.properties</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在特定行后插入内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/\\[core-site\\]/a\\    fs.defaultFS=hdfs://namenode:9000'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hadoop.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 提取特定范围的行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '100,200p'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> huge_log.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"日志处理实战\">日志处理实战</h3><p>大数据集群会产生海量日志，高效的日志分析是运维的核心技能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# 日志分析脚本：统计 Spark 作业失败原因&#10;&#10;LOG_DIR=&quot;/var/log/spark&quot;&#10;DATE=$(date -d &quot;yesterday&quot; +%Y-%m-%d)&#10;REPORT=&quot;/tmp/spark_daily_report_${DATE}.txt&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;=== Spark 作业日报 ${DATE} ===&quot; &gt; &quot;$REPORT&quot;&#10;&#10;# 统计各级别日志数量&#10;echo -e &quot;\\n[日志级别分布]&quot; &gt;&gt; &quot;$REPORT&quot;&#10;for level in INFO WARN ERROR FATAL; do&#10;    count=$(grep -c &quot;^${DATE}.*${level}&quot; &quot;${LOG_DIR}/spark.log&quot;)&#10;    echo &quot;  ${level}: ${count}&quot; &gt;&gt; &quot;$REPORT&quot;&#10;done&#10;&#10;# 提取 ERROR 的 Top 5 异常类型&#10;echo -e &quot;\\n[Top 5 异常类型]&quot; &gt;&gt; &quot;$REPORT&quot;&#10;grep &quot;^${DATE}.*ERROR&quot; &quot;${LOG_DIR}/spark.log&quot; \\&#10;    | grep -oP &#39;(?&lt;=Exception: ).*&#39; \\&#10;    | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -5 &gt;&gt; &quot;$REPORT&quot;&#10;&#10;# OOM 检测&#10;oom_count=$(grep -c &quot;OutOfMemoryError&quot; &quot;${LOG_DIR}/spark.log&quot;)&#10;if [ &quot;$oom_count&quot; -gt 0 ]; then&#10;    echo -e &quot;\\n⚠️ 检测到 ${oom_count} 次 OOM，建议增加 executor 内存&quot; &gt;&gt; &quot;$REPORT&quot;&#10;fi&#10;&#10;cat &quot;$REPORT&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 日志分析脚本：统计 Spark 作业失败原因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LOG_DIR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/var/log/spark\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"yesterday\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%Y-%m-%d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REPORT</span><span styl