><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 集群健康检查脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">NODES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node1\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"node2\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"node3\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"node4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ALERT_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">NODES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 检查 SSH 连通性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ssh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ConnectTimeout=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"echo ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/dev/null; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"[ALERT] ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 无法连接\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 检查磁盘使用率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    disk_usage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ssh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"df / | tail -1 | awk '{print </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5}' | tr -d '%'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$disk_usage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -ge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$ALERT_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"[WARN] ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 磁盘使用率 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">disk_usage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 检查关键进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DataNode\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"NodeManager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ssh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pgrep -f </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$proc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/dev/null; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"[ALERT] ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 进程 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">proc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 未运行\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure as Code</strong>：Ansible/Terraform 取代手工 Shell 脚本管理集群，但 Shell 仍是 IaC 工具的底层执行引擎</li>\n<li><strong>容器化运维</strong>：Docker/K8s 环境下，Shell 脚本用于健康检查（liveness/readiness probe）和初始化容器</li>\n<li><strong>AI 运维助手</strong>：自然语言转 Shell 命令工具（如 <code>ai-shell</code>）降低了命令行学习门槛，但理解底层原理仍不可替代</li>\n<li><strong>eBPF 观测</strong>：新一代 Linux 可观测性工具（bpftrace）使性能诊断从&quot;猜测&quot;变为&quot;精确度量&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>编写一个 Shell 脚本，扫描 <code>/var/log/</code> 下所有 <code>.log</code> 文件，找出 24 小时内修改过的文件，统计其行数并按大小降序输出</li>\n<li>用 AWK 处理一个 CSV 格式的销售数据（字段：日期、产品、地区、金额），按地区分组计算月度总销售额</li>\n<li>设置 Cron 任务：每天凌晨 3 点压缩 7 天前的日志文件（<code>gzip</code>），每月 1 日删除 90 天前的压缩日志</li>\n<li>思考：在什么场景下应该用 Shell 脚本，什么场景下应该用 Python？两者的边界在哪里？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Linux 与 Shell 脚本是大数据工程师的&quot;瑞士军刀&quot;——文件操作、进程管理、日志分析、定时调度、集群运维都离不开它。AWK 和 SED 提供了轻量高效的文本处理能力，Cron 实现基础的任务调度，而结构化的 Shell 脚本将这些单个命令编排为可靠的自动化工作流。这些技能在后续操作 Hadoop/Spark 集群时将每天使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Linux 与 Shell 脚本","id":"linux-与-shell-脚本"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"文件系统与权限管理","id":"文件系统与权限管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Cron 定时调度","id":"cron-定时调度"},{"level":3,"text":"AWK 文本处理","id":"awk-文本处理"},{"level":3,"text":"SED 流编辑器","id":"sed-流编辑器"},{"level":3,"text":"日志处理实战","id":"日志处理实战"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化运维脚本","id":"自动化运维脚本"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SQL 与数据库基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/sql-database-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"Hadoop 生态","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/hadoop-ecosystem"}}